  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;Translational degrees of freedom</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Monoatomic gases</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> Translational, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> rotational degrees of freedoms</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Polyatomic gases</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> Translational, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> rotational and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> vibrational degrees of freedom</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Rigid diatomic gases</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> Translational, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> rotational and more than one vibrational degrees of freedom</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>Nonrigid diatomic gases</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
